      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPECIAL STYLE (1) flew the lids from out wide with a slick early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow sixth (22.98) over 400m at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Key runner on her best form. BUMPY BLUE (7) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only half a length from the winner Almost in second(22.55) at Gosford. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can measure up. IRON LADY (2) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only a nose from the winner Paper Shredder in third(23.29) at The Gardens. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Must be included in calculations. AUSSIE RATTLER (8) cannot be ruled out.",
